{"seq":3,"slug":"rendering-performance","title":"渲染性能调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/rendering/rendering-performance","wordCount":776,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"渲染性能调优\">渲染性能调优</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SwiftUI 的声明式模型隐藏了大量渲染细节，但当列表滚动卡顿、动画掉帧或内存飙升时，开发者必须理解底层的 View Identity 机制、Attribute Graph 差分算法和懒容器的预加载策略。性能调优的核心原则：<strong>减少不必要的 body 求值，稳定 View Identity，控制 Attribute Graph 节点数量</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    StateChange[状态变化] --&gt; AG[Attribute Graph 标记脏节点]&#10;    AG --&gt; Diff[差分:比较新旧 View 树]&#10;    Diff --&gt;|Identity 匹配| Update[更新已有节点]&#10;    Diff --&gt;|Identity 不匹配| Destroy[销毁旧节点 + 创建新节点]&#10;    Update --&gt; Render[Core Animation 提交]&#10;    Destroy --&gt; Render&#10;    Render --&gt; Frame[60/120 fps 帧]\">flowchart TD\n    StateChange[状态变化] --&gt; AG[Attribute Graph 标记脏节点]\n    AG --&gt; Diff[差分:比较新旧 View 树]\n    Diff --&gt;|Identity 匹配| Update[更新已有节点]\n    Diff --&gt;|Identity 不匹配| Destroy[销毁旧节点 + 创建新节点]\n    Update --&gt; Render[Core Animation 提交]\n    Destroy --&gt; Render\n    Render --&gt; Frame[60/120 fps 帧]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性能维度</th>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>诊断工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>过度 body 求值</td>\n<td>滚动卡顿、CPU 尖峰</td>\n<td>Instruments → SwiftUI View Body</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Identity 抖动</td>\n<td>动画跳变、状态丢失</td>\n<td><code>Self._printChanges()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存膨胀</td>\n<td>LazyVStack 内存持续增长</td>\n<td>Instruments → Allocations</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主线程阻塞</td>\n<td>首帧延迟、响应卡顿</td>\n<td>Instruments → Time Profiler</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPU 过载</td>\n<td>复杂阴影/模糊导致掉帧</td>\n<td>Instruments → Metal System Trace</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"view-identity-与-structural-identity\">View Identity 与 Structural Identity</h2><p>SwiftUI 用两种 Identity 追踪视图生命周期：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Structural Identity</strong>（结构标识）：由视图在 body 中的位置决定。同一位置的同类型视图被视为同一实例。</li>\n<li><strong>Explicit Identity</strong>：通过 <code>.id()</code> modifier 或 <code>ForEach</code> 的 id 参数显式标记。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// 陷阱：条件分支导致 Identity 切换，状态丢失&#10;var body: some View {&#10;    if isLoggedIn {&#10;        HomeView() // structural identity = &quot;if-true branch&quot;&#10;    } else {&#10;        LoginView() // structural identity = &quot;if-false branch&quot;&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 优化：保持 Identity 稳定，用 opacity/offset 控制可见性&#10;var body: some View {&#10;    ZStack {&#10;        HomeView().opacity(isLoggedIn ? 1 : 0)&#10;        LoginView().opacity(isLoggedIn ? 0 : 1)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 陷阱：条件分支导致 Identity 切换，状态丢失</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> View {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> isLoggedIn {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        HomeView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// structural identity = \"if-true branch\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        LoginView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// structural identity = \"if-false branch\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 优化：保持 Identity 稳定，用 opacity/offset 控制可见性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> View {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ZStack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        HomeView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(isLoggedIn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        LoginView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(isLoggedIn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"_printchanges-诊断\">_printChanges() 诊断</h2><p>在 body 中临时插入 <code>Self._printChanges()</code> 可打印触发本次 body 求值的原因：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"var body: some View {&#10;    let _ = Self._printChanges()&#10;    // 输出示例：ProfileView: @self, @identity, _username changed.&#10;    Text(username)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> View {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> _</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">_printChanges</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 输出示例：ProfileView: @self, @identity, _username changed.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    Text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(username)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常见输出解读：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>@self</code> 变化 → 视图 struct 本身被重建（父级 body 重新求值）</li>\n<li><code>@identity</code> 变化 → View Identity 切换，全量重建</li>\n<li><code>_propertyName</code> 变化 → 某个 @State/@Binding 属性变化</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"懒容器性能策略\">懒容器性能策略</h2><p><code>LazyVStack</code> / <code>LazyVGrid</code> 仅在子视图进入可见区域时创建，但不会自动回收已创建的视图：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// 问题：大列表内存持续增长&#10;LazyVStack {&#10;    ForEach(items) { item in&#10;        ExpensiveRow(item: item) // 创建后不会被销毁&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 优化策略 1：限制预加载范围（iOS 17+）&#10;ScrollView {&#10;    LazyVStack {&#10;        ForEach(items) { item in&#10;            ItemRow(item: item)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;    .scrollTargetLayout()&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 优化策略 2：对图片使用异步加载 + 缓存&#10;AsyncImage(url: item.imageURL) { phase in&#10;    switch phase {&#10;    case .success(let image):&#10;        image.resizable().aspectRatio(contentMode: .fill)&#10;    case .failure:&#10;        Image(systemName: &quot;photo&quot;)&#10;    case .empty:&#10;        ProgressView()&#10;    @unknown default:&#10;        EmptyView()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 问题：大列表内存持续增长</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">LazyVStack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ForEach</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(items) { item </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        ExpensiveRow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: item) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 创建后不会被销毁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 优化策略 1：限制预加载范围（iOS 17+）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ScrollView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    LazyVStack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        ForEach</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(items) { item </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            ItemRow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">scrollTargetLayout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 优化策略 2：对图片使用异步加载 + 缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">AsyncImage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: item.imageURL) { phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> phase {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">success</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> image)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        image.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">resizable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">aspectRatio</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">contentMode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .fill)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .failure</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        Image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">systemName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"photo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .empty</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        ProgressView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @unknown</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        EmptyView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"equatable-优化\">Equatable 优化</h2><p>让视图遵循 Equatable 可以让 SwiftUI 跳过不必要的 body 求值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"struct ExpensiveChart: View, Equatable {&#10;    let data: [DataPoint]&#10;    let title: String&#10;&#10;    static func == (lhs: Self, rhs: Self) -&gt; Bool {&#10;        lhs.data.count == rhs.data.count &amp;&amp; lhs.title == rhs.title&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    var body: some View {&#10;        // 复杂的图表渲染&#10;        ChartRenderer(data: data)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 使用时用 .equatable() modifier&#10;ExpensiveChart(data: chartData, title: &quot;Revenue&quot;)&#10;    .equatable()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ExpensiveChart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">View</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Equatable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data: [DataPoint]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> title: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">lhs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rhs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        lhs.data.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rhs.data.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#7