><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(item.isTitle </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .title </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .body)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">foregroundStyle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(item.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">color</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(item.isTitle </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 16</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"instruments-swiftui-时间线实战\">Instruments SwiftUI 时间线实战</h2><p>Xcode Instruments 的 SwiftUI template 提供三个关键 instrument：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>View Body</strong>：显示每个 View 的 body 被求值的时刻和耗时</li>\n<li><strong>View Properties</strong>：追踪哪些属性变化触发了 body 求值</li>\n<li><strong>Core Animation Commits</strong>：CA 层的提交频率和耗时</li>\n</ol>\n<p>调优流程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>运行 Profile（Cmd+I），选择 SwiftUI template</li>\n<li>执行可复现的操作（如快速滚动列表）</li>\n<li>在 View Body instrument 中找到高频/高耗时的 View</li>\n<li>对照 View Properties 确认是否存在不必要的属性变化</li>\n<li>应用 Equatable / 拆分 View / 稳定 Identity 等优化手段</li>\n<li>再次 Profile 验证改善效果</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"drawinggroup-与-gpu-加速\">drawingGroup 与 GPU 加速</h2><p>当视图树包含大量叠加层（阴影、模糊、渐变）时，可使用 <code>drawingGroup()</code> 将子树压平为单一 Metal 纹理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"ZStack {&#10;    ForEach(0..&lt;100) { i in&#10;        Circle()&#10;            .fill(.blue.opacity(0.3))&#10;            .frame(width: 50, height: 50)&#10;            .offset(x: CGFloat(i) * 2, y: CGFloat(i) * 2)&#10;            .shadow(radius: 5)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;.drawingGroup() // 压平为单一 GPU 纹理\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ZStack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ForEach</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">..&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) { i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        Circle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.blue.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">width</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">offset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">x</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CGFloat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">y</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CGFloat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">shadow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">radius</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">drawingGroup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 压平为单一 GPU 纹理</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意：<code>drawingGroup()</code> 会禁用子树的独立动画能力，仅在确认性能瓶颈在 GPU 合成时使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>View Identity 稳定性是性能和正确性的基石——Identity 切换 = 全量销毁重建</li>\n<li><code>Self._printChanges()</code> 是诊断过度刷新的第一工具</li>\n<li>懒容器不回收已创建视图，需配合异步加载和分页控制内存</li>\n<li>Equatable 让 SwiftUI 跳过不变视图的 body 求值</li>\n<li>drawingGroup 将复杂子树离屏渲染为 GPU 纹理，适用于大量叠加图层</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"advanced-animations\">本章：进阶动画与视觉编排</a> — 动画性能与帧预算的平衡策略</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../swiftui-in-depth/fundamentals/view-identity-and-lifetime\">SwiftUI 深入 - View Identity 与生命周期</a> — View Identity 的完整机制与 Structural vs Explicit Identity</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../ios-architecture/large-scale-practices/build-time-optimization\">iOS 架构 - 构建时间优化</a> — 大型项目中 SwiftUI 编译性能的模块化策略</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"渲染性能调优","id":"渲染性能调优"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"View Identity 与 Structural Identity","id":"view-identity-与-structural-identity"},{"level":2,"text":"_printChanges() 诊断","id":"_printchanges-诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"懒容器性能策略","id":"懒容器性能策略"},{"level":2,"text":"Equatable 优化","id":"equatable-优化"},{"level":2,"text":"减少 Attribute Graph 复杂度","id":"减少-attribute-graph-复杂度"},{"level":2,"text":"Instruments SwiftUI 时间线实战","id":"instruments-swiftui-时间线实战"},{"level":2,"text":"drawingGroup 与 GPU 加速","id":"drawinggroup-与-gpu-加速"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"进阶动画与视觉编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/rendering/advanced-animations"},"next":{"title":"SwiftData 持久化集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/integration/swiftdata-integration"}}